TMF V1 policy freeze evidence
Date: 2026-09-20
Branch: codex/tmf-webbing-management
HEAD: ed9daa9c1c75fccadd8eb0901ec1876bbee41928

Frozen prototype defaults:
- scope: PMS purchase -> base production -> upstream dye/print -> TMF cut/tip -> accessory warehouse -> production receipt
- no long-term fixed-length finished-goods stocking
- factories: FAC-SPF / FAC-TMF / FAC-APF
- supplier identity remains separate from factory identity
- ordinary warehouse receives; warehouse supervisor confirms over-receipt
- TMF supervisor owns processing/disposition confirmation
- production receiver confirms final production receipt
- PDA: 360x640; supervisor Web: 1024x768
- labels: 150x100mm and A4; default validity: 24 hours
- over-receipt, scrap, freeze, return and version replan require role, reason and second confirmation
- fixture reset is isolated and never clears user records

Evidence:
- src/data/fcs/tmf-product-policy.ts
- tests/unit/tmf-product-policy.test.ts (2/2 pass)
- tests/unit/tmf-purchase-base-flow.test.ts: base order retains purchaseLineId

This freezes V1 prototype behavior only. Real photos and site-specific receiving/authorization records remain separate acceptance gates.
